  "ingredients": [
    "1 1/4 cup mozzarella cheese (shredded)",
    "4 tablespoon almond flour",
    "3 tablespoon coconut flour",
    "1 teaspoon italian seasoning",
    "salt and pepper (to taste)",
    "1 large egg",
    "4 ounce ham (deli slices)",
    "3 1/2 ounce cheddar cheese (sliced)"
  ],
  "instructions": [
    {
      "text": "Preheat oven to 400F. Melt the mozzarella in a microwave or toaster oven. This will take about 1 minute in the microwave and 10-second intervals afterward, or about 10 minutes in the oven, stirring occasionally.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/ham-and-cheese-keto-stromboli/#wprm-recipe-51831-step-0-0",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2015/10/01Melted-mozz.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Combine the almond and coconut flours in a bowl with Italian seasoning and salt and pepper.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/ham-and-cheese-keto-stromboli/#wprm-recipe-51831-step-0-1",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2015/10/02Combine-flours.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Once the mozzarella is melted, add it to the flour mixture and begin working it in.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/ham-and-cheese-keto-stromboli/#wprm-recipe-51831-step-0-2",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2015/10/03Mix-mozz-and-flours.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "After about a minute, when the cheese has had a chance to cool down a bit, add in the egg and combine everything together. It helps to use two utensils here.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/ham-and-cheese-keto-stromboli/#wprm-recipe-51831-step-0-3",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2015/10/04Mix-in-egg.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Once everything is combined and you've got a moist dough, transfer it to a flat surface lined with parchment paper.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/ham-and-cheese-keto-stromboli/#wprm-recipe-51831-step-0-4",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2015/10/05Done-dough.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Lay a second sheet of parchment paper over the dough ball and use a rolling pin or your hands to flatten it out.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/ham-and-cheese-keto-stromboli/#wprm-recipe-51831-step-0-5",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2015/10/06Roll-out.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Use a pizza cutter or knife to cut diagonal lines from the edges of the dough to the center, leave a row of dough untouched about 4\" wide.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/ham-and-cheese-keto-stromboli/#wprm-recipe-51831-step-0-6",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2015/10/07Flat-and-cut.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add alternating layers of sliced ham and cheddar on top of the uncut stretch of dough.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/ham-and-cheese-keto-stromboli/#wprm-recipe-51831-step-0-7",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2015/10/08Stuff.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Lift the sections of dough one at a time and fold them over to cover the filling.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/ham-and-cheese-keto-stromboli/#wprm-recipe-51831-step-0-8",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2015/10/09Fold-over.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake for about 15–20 minutes or until golden brown.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/ham-and-cheese-keto-stromboli/#wprm-recipe-51831-step-0-9",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2015/10/10Golden-brown.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Slice up and serve!",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/ham-and-cheese-keto-stromboli/#wprm-recipe-51831-step-0-10",
      "imageSource": null
    }
  ],
